# Events and roles
#
# The event is a node, the participants hang off it with named roles.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m05_events> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Events and roles" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: crm:E7_Activity

iy:Transfer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .
iy:Movement a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .
iy:Violence a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .
iy:Deposit a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Transfer .
iy:Purchase a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Transfer .
iy:Offer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .

iy:instrument a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:place a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:source a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:companion a owl:ObjectProperty .
